{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/m6v0gjc033pighlg9w49d123r6kpyxz.mp3","text":"嗯，我来保护博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/crnitugxkd6wys11w72rw5lx5yot7y6.mp3","text":"我可以去坐下？不行，我是护卫。身为护卫，就应该时刻守护在对象的身边才行......难道说，我站在这里给您添麻烦了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/73/la0dlb8rppykfc8l0vvlemcaa3v02oh.mp3","text":"斑点，我以前见过他......不，只是我当时的部队经过他驻守的城市时，他有帮过我。他应该不记得了，没关系。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/l6h14fazzas080dfqwjtpnez3ftbfm9.mp3","text":"（博士在做的事虽然看不懂，但是感觉好厉害）......欸，啊，我、我什么都没说，您听错了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/r05o5mkgbdc9vm0shxr2a8v5eww6vt4.mp3","text":"博士，这些，我记得您刚才有提到，就去帮您拿来了。那个，我没有做多余的事吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/93/p3yafrvhioks8vkmt9sx9zri2g70m5g.mp3","text":"博士，对不起，上次任务我又一个人冲出去了......我当时看到有人受伤，就感觉脑子像充血一样，忘记了您的命令冲了过去，我不是故意的，请、请不要讨厌我......","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/pm3a6tmeazxuk9mm2gboiw2l4y6zdvs.mp3","text":"啊，博士，您在找我吗？......不，我并不是躲着您，也没有讨厌您，只是......对不起，我不知道该怎么说......","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/60/k5teaeqk2dvpvx8axhb4wayax1r7qn8.mp3","text":"在萨尔贡当兵的时候，其他人都不喜欢我，只有一个人对我很好，她是我最好的朋友。但是，最后她却骗了我......博士，我已经不知道了，我该怎么样去信任别人呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/kv5svkzkyuemg3tfr7n0hu9qlyyx4ts.mp3","text":"（博士对我真好，明明我是个这么讨人厌的人，还愿意对我好好说话，果然，相信博士一定是没问题的吧。）啊，博士，我在听，嗯，我还是想相信博士。博士的敌人，就是我的敌人！","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/evekrk0xfrnmqykiroluhqgtkxkdhna.mp3","text":"（有点想看......博士的睡脸）","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/1ucco1stasitgnv28u1x2rrys6dz6km.mp3","text":"（看起来，好像是个很和善的人，不知道真的像阿米娅说的那样好相处吗......）啊，那个，对不起，我、我走神了，干员代号，暴雨，报到。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/nsw4ifo70ve21eh89uj07o0vdvi1pai.mp3","text":"嗯，我也会达到这个水平。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/fq97gkz9ufxef6bukxl24dn4102jui0.mp3","text":"（阿米娅也在这里，我难道要被开除了吗......）欸，升职？","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/gj9zcfeyxxcmf2dypnw0ks1sawv6scg.mp3","text":"博士，我可不可以不升职......不，你们对我太好了，我有些害怕......","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/5cijh9myrxkgmltenjswz12m4gl2vn6.mp3","text":"遵命。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/438ygkwmvffo3jh8vc3igkh8vubxnzj.mp3","text":"......我会尽力。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/s1fwm326i8rm6gna3u0dd21ikvwikvq.mp3","text":"（决不能辜负博士的期望......）","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/kgc4b3rczwx27hmtdg14uzer2e2jbq9.mp3","text":"准备接敌！","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/t7j9ei5c21ljd2d56vc3hmts4mx1riy.mp3","text":"我在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/m0xuyzvvaexzwn6g6o61080drsenfj7.mp3","text":"博士，有什么吩咐？","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/e7tquf7b3qyvmm5k2zg348hfjhoql32.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/62/8k56g6v7sjik0pu83jfof585z5xd081.mp3","text":"这里就好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/oyococ3j5gh4nsbew0qp01z0jwvehsj.mp3","text":"去死。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/tgs0zua0jj5gcj8jsc1bd2e6kevhjay.mp3","text":"闪开！","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/pl3nhrjnjv5kvsum2krd62ikkjolt3x.mp3","text":"碍事！","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/0c44s75vvzzn2rirt7ls0e66zcoi0wb.mp3","text":"哼！","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/kuh00yzrqdj7n0i9d08zjgyvyme5bzs.mp3","text":"博士，我做的还好吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/q1jct58jgrx4jmr61l76mcebd43ftqf.mp3","text":"博士，我还能战斗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_304_zebra/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwi